  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "たいないで　せきたんを　つくりだす。\nむかしの　ガラルでは　おとした\nせきたんを　せいかつに　りようした。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "체내에서 석탄을 만들어 낸다.\n과거의 가라르에서는 떨어뜨린\n석탄을 생활에 이용했다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "能在體內製造煤炭。\n在過去，伽勒爾人曾經用\n牠身上掉下來的煤炭生活。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il produit du charbon dans son corps. Jadis, les\nhabitants de Galar ramassaient ce charbon au sol\net s’en servaient pour leurs besoins quotidiens.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es produziert Steinkohle in seinem Körper.\nDie von ihm abfallende Kohle wurde früher in\nder Galar-Region fürs tägliche Leben genutzt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Forma carbón en el interior de su cuerpo. Los\nantiguos habitantes de Galar lo aprovechaban\npara sus labores diarias.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Gli antichi abitanti di Galar usavano il carbone\nprodotto da questo Pokémon all’interno del suo\ncorpo per le loro necessità quotidiane.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It forms coal inside its body. Coal dropped by\nthis Pokémon once helped fuel the lives of\npeople in the Galar region.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "体内で　石炭を　つくりだす。\n昔の　ガラルでは　落とした\n石炭を　生活に　利用した。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "能在体内制造煤炭。\n在过去，伽勒尔人曾经用\n它身上掉下来的煤炭生活。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Forma carbón en el interior de su cuerpo. Los\nantiguos habitantes de Galar lo aprovechaban\npara sus labores diarias.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "あしを　こうそくで　かいてんさせて\nじそく３０キロで　はしる。　せっし\n１０００どの　ほのおを　ふきだす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "다리를 고속으로 회전시켜\n시속 30km로 달린다.\n섭씨 1000도의 불꽃을 내뿜는다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "能透過高速旋轉自己的腳，\n以３０公里的時速奔跑。\n能噴出攝氏１０００度的火焰。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il peut faire tourner ses pattes très vite\npour se déplacer à une vitesse de 30 km/h.\nIl peut aussi souffler des flammes à 1 000 °C.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es dreht seine Füße mit hoher Geschwindigkeit\nund kann sich dadurch bis zu 30 km/h schnell\nbewegen. Es speit 1 000 ºC heiße Flammen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Gira las patas a gran velocidad para correr a\nunos 30 km/h. Emite llamas a una temperatura\nde 1000 °C.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Corre a 30 km/h facendo girare velocemente\nle zampe. Emette fiamme a 1.000 ºC.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "By rapidly rolling its legs, it can travel at over\n18 mph. The temperature of the flames it\nbreathes exceeds 1,800 degrees Fahrenheit.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "脚を　高速で　回転させて\n時速３０キロで　走る。　摂氏\n１０００度の　炎を　噴き出す。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "能通过高速旋转自己的脚，\n以３０公里的时速奔跑。\n能喷出１０００度的火焰。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Gira las patas a gran velocidad para correr a\nunos 30 km/h. Emite llamas a una temperatura\nde 1000 °C.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "かんじょうが　たかぶるとたいないの　おんどが　じょうしょう。ほのおを　ふきながら　せわしなく　はしる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "흥분하게 되면 체내의 온도가 상승하여 불꽃을 뿜으며 정신없이 달린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "情緒只要激昂起來，體內的溫度就會上升。會噴著火焰忙碌地奔跑。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lorsqu’il est en proie à d’intenses émotions, sa température augmente et il se met à courir frénétiquement en crachant des flammes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Wird dieses Pokémon von starken Emotionen erfasst, steigt seine Körpertemperatur und es rollt hektisch umher, während es Flammen speit.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su temperatura corporal asciende cuando se emociona. Corre de un lado a otro frenéticamente escupiendo fuego.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se si emoziona, la sua temperatura interna sale. Corre freneticamente qua e là sputando fiamme.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The temperature inside its body increases when it experiences strong emotions. It rolls around frantically while spewing flames.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "感情が　昂ると体内の　温度が　上昇。炎を　吹きながら　忙しなく　走る。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "只要情绪激昂起来，体内的温度就会上升，会一喷出火焰一边匆忙地奔跑。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su temperatura corporal asciende cuando se emociona. Corre de un lado a otro frenéticamente escupiendo fuego.",
      "language": {
